      "sourceTextSha256": "63c91299979416f05dcbf6d99bfd01797cecd051a90c115ee152878a28efbd4e",
      "text": "Day 12 · Transfer to Calama airport for your flight to Santiago; meeting at the airport with a guide and transfer to the hotel. Santiago has interesting historic, residential and business districts: in the historic centre, the Plaza de Armas has monuments to the city’s founder, Pedro de Valdivia, to American Liberty and to Chile’s first cardinal, José María Caro, close to La Moneda, the neoclassical presidential palace, the Cathedral and the Central Post Office.",
