      "sourceTextSha256": "f89245f754980c1e8036ca9ab3c9cec7e16b395f0d8207d76bc51ef0b91dc708",
      "text": "Day 13 · After breakfast, city tour beginning with a general view of the city from halfway up San Cristóbal Hill, then the historic centre with the Main Square, the Cathedral, the Post Office, the City Hall and La Moneda, the Government House. Continue to East Santiago, with its modern offices, apartments, shopping centres and restaurants. Return to the hotel.",
